{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSExpression","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSExpression","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"symbolPlacement","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default value of this property is an expression that evaluates to "},{"code":"point","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Set this property to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" to reset it to the default value."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can set this property to an expression containing any of the following:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Constant "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MLNSymbolPlacement"},{"type":"text","text":" values"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Any of the following constant string values:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"point"},{"text":": The label is placed at the point where the geometry is located.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"line","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The label is placed along the line of the geometry. Can only be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"used on ","type":"text"},{"code":"LineString","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Polygon","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" geometries.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"line-center"},{"type":"text","text":": The label is placed at the center of the line of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"geometry. Can only be used on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LineString"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Polygon"},{"type":"text","text":" geometries. Note that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a single feature in a vector tile may contain multiple line geometries.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Predefined functions, including mathematical and string operators"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Conditional expressions","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Variable assignments and references to assigned variables","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Step functions applied to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"$zoomLevel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" variable","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This property does not support applying interpolation functions to the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"$zoomLevel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" variable or applying interpolation or step functions to feature","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attributes."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Label placement relative to its geometry."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/symbolPlacement","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"metadata":{"title":"symbolPlacement","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"symbolPlacement"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"symbolPlacement"}],"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNSymbolStyleLayer(py)symbolPlacement","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsymbolstylelayer\/symbolplacement"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNSymbolStyleLayer/symbolPlacement":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Label placement relative to its geometry."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/symbolPlacement","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"symbolPlacement","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsymbolstylelayer\/symbolplacement","title":"symbolPlacement"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","title":"MapLibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNSymbolStyleLayer":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer","fragments":[{"text":"MLNSymbolStyleLayer","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a style layer that renders icon and text labels"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at points or along lines on the map."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsymbolstylelayer","title":"MLNSymbolStyleLayer"}}}